      "message": "```\nERROR: The following kernel modules are built but not copied. Add these lines to the module_outs attribute of //common-modules/virtual-device:virtual_device_aarch64:\n    \"test_meminit.ko\",\n    \"test_stackinit.ko\",\n```\n\nSomething is wrong here. Why are these modules generated for the virtual device build? They should only be generated for the GKI build.\n\nMaybe instead of gki_defconfig, these should go to the fragment config so it only affects GKI builds? So these modules aren\u0027t built for device builds?\n\nRamji, can you provide some guidance here?\n    ",
