      "side": 1,
      "message": "gki_defconfig (some config set \u003d m) : GKI build with modules\ngki_defconfig (some config set \u003d m) + device.frament: GKI modules built again with device modules.\n\nThis is the exact issue William was pointing out which can be solve with fragment approch (option#2). But build time was the no go for it. I agreed with William, and he thought there is a better way to handle mixed builds which doesn\u0027t add build time and doesn\u0027t present this issue.",
