      "writtenOn": "2022-01-14T17:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a tricky problem to solve in general because we need to have the GKI modules CONFIG_* defined in the .config in case a vendor module depends on the GKI modules. For now we can workaround this by updating the bazel files to ignore the gki modules for the vendor builds (when compiling a GKI mixed build).",
      "parentUuid": "5354fceb_475a9084",
      "revId": "abc7b1734c8303a358d0be6378c589bf5084182c",
