      "side": 1,
      "message": "Probably, MODULES_LIST is for that purpose; where only modules listed in that file gets copied; then we don\u0027t have to keep the fragment. Vendor builds all the vendor modules and GKI builds are already using the android/gki_system_dlkm_modules file for that purpose.",
